  <bpmn:process id="Process_41" name="Cake Preliminary Estimate Calculation" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>Sources: SRS FR-CAKE-04 and customer configuration interface; app/cake-builder.js summary and app/cake-state.js K.estimate. Show the current draft breakdown on opening the cake configuration and refresh it on each selection change. Use one option per required category: shape, size, flavor, color and icing. Sum the configured price of each selected cake option once. For incomplete selections show the available partial breakdown and withhold the preliminary total. For failed reads or invalid selections/prices, retain the draft and withhold the unavailable estimate, allowing corrections or retry. A configured zero price is valid. Proposed rule: round the option subtotal up once to the smallest multiple of ₱50 using 50 × ceiling(subtotal ÷ 50). The prototype uses the unrounded subtotal. Use the same proposed estimate when BPMN-07 rechecks the draft at submission. BPMN-08 owns the final quotation, including applicable add-on, design and delivery charges.</bpmn:documentation>
